</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Writer's access is required for the user to select a calendar as a linked calendar.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The linked calendar is by default added to the conflict calendar. This means any event created on the third-party linked calendar will be fetched in the system, and any event created in the system will be pushed to the third-party linked calendar.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can set your Sync Preferences from the Advanced Settings.</span></p><hr style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; padding: 0px 0px 3px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out, line-height 0.2s ease-out, opacity 0.1s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86); width: 720px; max-width: 720px; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; color: inherit;\">[Important] Integrating Google Meet</strong></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; padding: 0px 0px 3px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out, line-height 0.2s ease-out, opacity 0.1s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86); width: 720px; max-width: 720px; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">When you connect your Google Calendar, Google Meet is automatically integrated. To generate unique Google Meet links for each appointment, ensure your Google Calendar is set as the linked calendar. If no Google Calendar is set as the linked calendar, Google Meet links will not be generated.</p><hr><p></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; padding: 0px 0px 3px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out, line-height 0.2s ease-out, opacity 0.1s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86); width: 720px; max-width: 720px; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; color: inherit;\">Conflict Calendar:</strong></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; padding: 0px 0px 3px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out, line-height 0.2s ease-out, opacity 0.1s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86); width: 720px; max-width: 720px; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">Events from third-party calendars added as conflict calendars are synced to the system, blocking your availability for the event's duration.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; padding: 0px 0px 3px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: 