You'll get a message that says someone else verified the profile. If you're authorized to manage the profile, you can request ownership from the current profile owner.</p></li><li class=\"ql-rendered-ordered-list\" data-block-id=\"block-2013d47e-ec22-40b6-88a3-80c0bea6d74c\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0.25em 10px 0.25em 1.75em; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; list-style-type: none; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; counter-increment: list-0 1;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\">Click Request Access and fill out the form.</p></li><li class=\"ql-rendered-ordered-list\" data-block-id=\"block-fed7ef03-4a03-4188-858e-e40cacbc35be\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0.25em 10px 0.25em 1.75em; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; list-style-type: none; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; counter-increment: list-0 1;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-si